flowchart TD
    Start([Start: Trigger Schedule & Allocate]) --> CheckAuth{User Authorized as Admin or ATC?}
    CheckAuth -- No --> AccessDenied([Reject Operation: Access Denied])
    CheckAuth -- Yes --> LockQueue[Acquire ReadyQueue Mutex]

    LockQueue --> CheckQueueEmpty{Is ReadyQueue Empty?}
    CheckQueueEmpty -- Yes --> ReleaseQueue1[Release ReadyQueue Mutex]
    ReleaseQueue1 --> EndNoOp([No Waiting Processes: Return Success])

    CheckQueueEmpty -- No --> SelectCandidate[Scheduler::selectNextProcess<br/>Lowest effectivePriority ASC, arrivalTime ASC]
    SelectCandidate --> ReleaseQueue2[Release ReadyQueue Mutex]

    ReleaseQueue2 --> FindRunway[ApplicationService: Find Compatible Available Runway]
    FindRunway --> RunwayAvail{Compatible Available Runway Found?}

    RunwayAvail -- No --> EndBlocked([No Runway Available: Process Remains Ready])

    RunwayAvail -- Yes --> DispatchProc[Scheduler::dispatchNextProcess<br/>Transition Process to RUNNING]
    DispatchProc --> AcquireResLock[Acquire ResourceManager ScopedResourceLock std::mutex]

    AcquireResLock --> BeginTx[Begin Transaction: db.transaction]
    BeginTx --> RowLocks[Pessimistic Row Locks: SELECT FOR UPDATE on runways, runway_assignments, flights]
    RowLocks --> VerifyDbFree{Runway Available & Flight Eligible in DB?}
    
    VerifyDbFree -- No --> Rollback1[Rollback Transaction: db.rollback]
    Rollback1 --> RevertDispatch[Revert Process to READY & Release Mutex]
    RevertDispatch --> EndFail([Allocation Aborted])
    
    VerifyDbFree -- Yes --> InsertAssign[1. INSERT INTO runway_assignments status='Active']
    InsertAssign --> UpdateRunway[2. UPDATE runways SET status='Occupied']
    UpdateRunway --> UpdateFlight[3. UPDATE flights SET operational_status='Cleared']
    UpdateFlight --> InsertLog[4. INSERT INTO operation_logs transaction_status='Committed']

    InsertLog --> CheckAllSql{All SQL Mutations Succeeded?}
    CheckAllSql -- No --> Rollback2[Rollback Transaction: db.rollback]
    Rollback2 --> RevertDispatch

    CheckAllSql -- Yes --> CommitTx[Commit Transaction: db.commit]
    CommitTx --> UpdateMemState[ResourceManager: confirmAllocationUnlocked<br/>Mark In-Memory Runway Occupied]
    UpdateMemState --> ReleaseResLockSuccess[Release ScopedResourceLock std::mutex]
    ReleaseResLockSuccess --> NotifyUI[Emit Qt Signals to Update GUI Views]
    NotifyUI --> SuccessEnd([Success: Runway Allocated & Flight Dispatched])
